{%- comment -%}
  TODO — needs Yousif's input (spec's open question #2): what does "claim"
  actually do on submit? Confirmed UI copy from Phase 0 crawl, but the real
  lookup logic (order status redirect vs. custom redelivery flow) isn't
  something Shopify does natively — likely needs an app proxy to whatever
  backend currently powers /claim on the live site, or Shopify's built-in
